<title>GERMANY: Dresdner launches system to boost consultancy.</title>
<headline>Dresdner launches system to boost consultancy.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG said on Thursday it had launched new technology to back up its securities advisory service to customers.</p>
<p>Dresdner said its new service, DIVA, was developed in cooperation with Reuters and based on the Reuters Portfolio Management System.</p>
<p>DIVA combines all relevant information regarding the development of clients' securities holdings and thereby helps advisers to prepare discussions with clients, Dresdner said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
